    <bpmn:process id="W_W4979" name="W4979. Loading Damage, Shortage &amp; Wrong-Load Exception Resolution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Damage at loading (W4970); shortage/wrong item discovered; customer report
Frequency: Event-driven × 200 stores
Volume: ~10–20 loading exceptions per store per week × 200 stores
Owner: Loading-Zone Supervisor / Store Ops / CX (VS-13)
Participants: Loaders, Store Ops (VS-07), CX (VS-13), Returns (VS-32), Claims (VS-90), Inventory (VS-05)
Source: workflow W4979 — Loading Damage, Shortage &amp; Wrong-Load Exception Resolution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4979_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4979_Lane1" name="Loaders">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4979_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4979_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4979_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4979_Lane2" name="Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4979_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4979_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4979_Start4" name="Damage at loading (W4970); shortage/wrong item discovered; customer report">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4979_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4979_Task5" name="Capture &amp; assess the exception: at the bay or on customer report, document…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Capture &amp; assess the exception: at the bay or on customer report, document damage/shortage/wrong-load (photo, order, items), assess cause (loading error, staging error W4965, goods defect), and decide resolution
Responsible (R): Loaders / Supervisor / CX
Accountable (A): Loading-Zone Supervisor
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4979_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4979_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4979_Task6" name="Resolve: replace/refund the damaged/short/wrong item (links VS-32 returns…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Resolve: replace/refund the damaged/short/wrong item (links VS-32 returns, VS-90 damage claims), re-load the correct/complete order (W4970), issue service recovery per CX policy (VS-13), and reconcile inventory
Responsible (R): Loaders / Returns / CX / Inventory
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4979_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4979_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4979_Task7" name="Root-cause &amp; prevent: log the exception, root-cause…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Root-cause &amp; prevent: log the exception, root-cause (process/training/equipment), feed continuous improvement (W4981) and CAPA (VS-147 if safety), and prevent recurrence
Responsible (R): Supervisor / CX / Analytics / HSE
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4979_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4979_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4979_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4979_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4979_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-745 (ensure controlled execution — Pickup Experience, Exceptions, Chargeback &amp; Analytics (PA-171.3).) | - CTL-745: exception documented; resolved (replace/refund); inventory reconciled; root-caused &amp; CAPA&#x27;d
Owner: Loading-Zone Supervisor / Store Ops / CX (VS-13)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4979_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4979_Annotation9" targetRef="W4979_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4979_Flow11" sourceRef="W4979_Start4" targetRef="W4979_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4979_Flow12" sourceRef="W4979_Task5" targetRef="W4979_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4979_Flow13" sourceRef="W4979_Task6" targetRef="W4979_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4979_Flow14" sourceRef="W4979_Task7" targetRef="W4979_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
