        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-745 (ensure controlled execution — Pickup Experience, Exceptions, Chargeback &amp; Analytics (PA-171.3).) | - CTL-745: monthly performance review; improvements prioritized/tracked; outcomes measured vs KPIs
Owner: Customer Pickup Program Manager / Store Ops / Analytics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
