    <bpmn:process id="W_W4982" name="W4982. Loading-Zone Safety Incident, CAPA &amp; Customer-Injury Response" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Loading-zone incident/near-miss; customer/staff injury; property damage
Frequency: Event-driven × 200 stores
Volume: ~2–5 incidents/near-misses per store per year × 200 stores
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Customer Safety (VS-147) / Loading-Zone Supervisor
Participants: HSE (VS-24), Customer Safety (VS-147), Store Ops (VS-07), Occupational Health (VS-83), Legal/Claims (VS-100/VS-26), LP (VS-23)
Source: workflow W4982 — Loading-Zone Safety Incident, CAPA &amp; Customer-Injury Response</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4982_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4982_Lane1" name="HSE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4982_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4982_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4982_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4982_Lane2" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4982_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4982_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4982_Start4" name="Loading-zone incident/near-miss; customer/staff injury; property damage">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4982_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4982_Task5" name="Respond to the incident: secure the scene, provide first aid/medical (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Respond to the incident: secure the scene, provide first aid/medical (links VS-83), document (photo/witness/CCTV VS-27), and report per the incident protocol (links VS-24, VS-147 W330 emergency response)
Responsible (R): HSE / Store Mgr / Occupational Health
Accountable (A): HSE Lead / Store Mgr
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4982_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4982_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4982_Task6" name="Investigate &amp; CAPA: root-cause (equipment W4973, layout W4964, spotter W4971…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Investigate &amp; CAPA: root-cause (equipment W4973, layout W4964, spotter W4971, procedure), corrective/preventive actions, equipment/tag-out if needed, and feed the customer-safety CAPA (VS-147) and DOLE reportable (VS-24)
Responsible (R): HSE / Internal Audit / Store Ops
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4982_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4982_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4982_Task7" name="Manage claims &amp; liability: customer-injury/property claim (links VS-147…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage claims &amp; liability: customer-injury/property claim (links VS-147 premises liability, VS-26 insurance, VS-100 legal), insurance notification, settlement, and lessons-learned to prevent recurrence
Responsible (R): Legal / Claims / Insurance / HSE
Accountable (A): CFO / Legal
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4982_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4982_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4982_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4982_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4982_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-745 (ensure controlled execution — Pickup Experience, Exceptions, Chargeback &amp; Analytics (PA-171.3).) | - CTL-745: scene secured; incident documented; root-caused &amp; CAPA&#x27;d; DOLE-reportable handled; insurance notified
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Customer Safety (VS-147) / Loading-Zone Supervisor</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
