    <bpmn:process id="W_W4983" name="W4983. Pickup Loading Service Chargeback, Fees &amp; Documentation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Chargeable pickup/loading service; fee policy; billing cycle
Frequency: Per chargeable event + billing cycle
Volume: ~20,000–35,000 chargeable loading/pickup events per month × 200 stores
Owner: Loading-Zone Supervisor / Finance / Store Ops
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), Finance (VS-17/VS-16), CX (VS-13), B2B (VS-11)
Source: workflow W4983 — Pickup Loading Service Chargeback, Fees &amp; Documentation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4983_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4983_Lane1" name="Store Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4983_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4983_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4983_Lane2" name="Counter Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4983_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4983_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4983_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4983_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4983_Start5" name="Chargeable pickup/loading service; fee policy; billing cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4983_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4983_Task6" name="Define the chargeback/fee model: which pickup/loading services are chargeable…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define the chargeback/fee model: which pickup/loading services are chargeable (e.g., assisted loading, after-hours, oversized, B2B project staging), the fee structure, free-vs-charge thresholds, and the B2B/contract treatment (links VS-11)
Responsible (R): Store Ops / Finance / CX / B2B
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations / CFO
Duration: Per policy</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4983_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4983_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4983_Task7" name="Capture &amp; bill: capture chargeable events at the bay/counter, bill via POS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Capture &amp; bill: capture chargeable events at the bay/counter, bill via POS (VS-08) or order mgmt (VS-16), document the service (what/when/fee), and reconcile to revenue (VS-17)
Responsible (R): Counter Staff / Finance / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4983_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4983_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4983_Task8" name="Govern fairness &amp; analytics: review fee fairness/CX impact (links VS-13)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern fairness &amp; analytics: review fee fairness/CX impact (links VS-13), waivers for loyalty/B2B (VS-13/VS-11), fee-revenue analytics, and policy refinement
Responsible (R): Finance / CX / Program Manager / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4983_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4983_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
